codex
The MOVE code checks the same capital, breathing kind and reader evidence separately from absence. I found two reachable problems in the ordinary deletion path: it accepts reader or recogniser spans outside the saved window, and a zero recogniser confidence can authorize deletion even though zero is also the loader’s default for a missing score. I’m preserving those witnesses and testing them across modes.
