     2	
     3	Policy **`sf6-release-v1`**. The keraia witness is **HOLD**; **64/64 reviewer quote probes HOLD**. A release with an uncertified deletion becomes a whole-line HOLD. Insertions, SF5 text proposals, reader naming, agreement, observation predicates and K1 are unchanged.
